factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 4 problems
  Reel_script and caption say the python was rescued from the Onampalayam residential area in Thondamuthur, but the article says the complex is 'Western Valley Green Homes' in Thondamuthur area; the draft's location phrasing 'இடம்: ஓணம்பாளையம், தொண்டாமுத்தூர் அருகே' is acceptable, but slides_spec loc field is consistent; no issue there.
  Reel_script says the Trichy-based handler was 'வரவழைக்கப்பட்டார்' and 'அனுபவம் கொண்ட' which is accurate, but the caption says the python was rescued by the handler 'பிரகாஷ்' who is a Trichy experienced handler now running a Cane Corso dog centre in Coimbatore; the draft omits that he now runs a dog breeding centre in Coimbatore, which is a minor detail rather than an error.
  Reel_script states the snake was 'உடலில் சில இடங்களில் காயத்துடன்' while the article says it was injured; fine. However caption says the python was released 'அதே பகுதியில்' which matches the article.
  Caption states the handler was called by 'திருச்சி தீயணைப்புத் துறை, வனத்துறையுடன் பணியாற்றிய' which conflates two sources; the article says he worked with the Trichy fire department and forest department, so the phrasing is acceptable but the caption's line 'இதனால் திருச்சி தீயணைப்புத் துறை, வனத்துறையுடன் பணியாற்றிய அனுபவமுள்ள பாம்பு பிடி வீரர் பிரகாஷ் அங்கு வரவழைக்கப்பட்டார்' reads as if the fire department summoned him, which the article does not state.
